comm_text0: dc.b 'Dumping cargo near this station is illegal.',0
comm_text1: dc.b 'Cargo dumping is prohibited in the station zone.',0
comm_text2: dc.b 'Illegal cargo disposal detected. This offence has been recorded.',0
comm_text3: dc.b 'Keep the station zone clear. Do not dump cargo here.',0
comm_text4: dc.b 'Unauthorized cargo dumping. Your legal record has been updated.',0
comm_text5: dc.b 'Have a good flight.',0
comm_text6: dc.b 'Fly safe.',0
comm_text7: dc.b 'Safe travels.',0
comm_text8: dc.b 'Good luck out there.',0
comm_text9: dc.b 'Until next time.',0
comm_text10: dc.b 'Have a safe journey.',0
comm_text11: dc.b 'Watch your six.',0
comm_text12: dc.b 'See you again soon.',0
comm_text13: dc.b 'Departure confirmed. Fly safe.',0
comm_text14: dc.b 'Have a profitable trip.',0
comm_text15: dc.b 'Permission to dock granted.',0
comm_text16: dc.b 'Cleared to dock.',0
comm_text17: dc.b 'Docking clearance granted.',0
comm_text18: dc.b 'Welcome. You may dock.',0
comm_text19: dc.b 'Docking permission approved.',0
comm_text20: dc.b 'Approach approved. Proceed to dock.',0
comm_text21: dc.b 'Dock when ready.',0
comm_text22: dc.b 'You may begin your docking approach.',0
comm_text23: dc.b 'Clearance confirmed. Approach safely.',0
comm_text24: dc.b 'Welcome to the station. Docking approved.',0
comm_text25: dc.b 'Vacate the area immediately.',0
comm_text26: dc.b 'Docking denied. Leave the station area.',0
comm_text27: dc.b 'You are not cleared to dock. Move away.',0
comm_text28: dc.b 'Keep clear of the station. Docking denied.',0
comm_text29: dc.b 'Docking access revoked. Leave immediately.',0
comm_text30: dc.b 'Docking granted, but you are not welcome here.',0
comm_text31: dc.b 'You may dock, despite your criminal record.',0
comm_text32: dc.b 'Docking approved. We have checked your record.',0
comm_text33: dc.b 'Cleared to dock. Keep your visit brief.',0
comm_text34: dc.b 'Docking permitted. You are being watched.',0
comm_text35: dc.b 'You may dock, but do not cause trouble.',0
comm_text36: dc.b 'Docking granted. Your record is a concern.',0
comm_text37: dc.b 'Clearance granted. We know your reputation.',0
comm_text38: dc.b 'Docking approved. Stay out of trouble.',0
comm_text39: dc.b 'You may dock. We will be watching you.',0
    even
comm_text40: dc.b "Safe travels, pilot.",0
comm_text41: dc.b "Good to see a friendly ship.",0
comm_text42: dc.b "May your next trade be profitable.",0
comm_text43: dc.b "Clear skies and a safe journey.",0
comm_text44: dc.b "Good luck on your route.",0
comm_text45: dc.b "Safe passage to your next port.",0
comm_text46: dc.b "Fly safe out there.",0
comm_text47: dc.b "Hope the markets treat you well.",0
comm_text48: dc.b "Quiet space. Let's keep it that way.",0
comm_text49: dc.b "All the best for the journey.",0
comm_text50: dc.b "I hope you're not looking for trouble.",0
comm_text51: dc.b "We're just traders. Let us pass.",0
comm_text52: dc.b "Keep your distance and we'll get along.",0
comm_text53: dc.b "No trouble from us.",0
comm_text54: dc.b "Let's both reach port in one piece.",0
comm_text55: dc.b "I hope you're not a pirate.",0
comm_text56: dc.b "We'd prefer a quiet journey.",0
comm_text57: dc.b "Passing through. No hostile intent.",0
comm_text58: dc.b "There's no need for trouble.",0
comm_text59: dc.b "Give us some room, pilot.",0
comm_text60: dc.b "You're dead!",0
comm_text61: dc.b "This is your end!",0
comm_text62: dc.b "You picked the wrong route.",0
comm_text63: dc.b "Your cargo is ours!",0
comm_text64: dc.b "Nowhere to hide!",0
comm_text65: dc.b "Your luck just ran out.",0
comm_text66: dc.b "Say goodbye to your ship!",0
comm_text67: dc.b "We've found our next victim.",0
comm_text68: dc.b "You won't leave here alive!",0
comm_text69: dc.b "Time to collect our prize!",0
comm_text70: dc.b "Good hunting, friend.",0
comm_text71: dc.b "One of us. Fly safe.",0
comm_text72: dc.b "Plenty of prey out here.",0
comm_text73: dc.b "May your next haul be rich.",0
comm_text74: dc.b "No trouble between friends.",0
comm_text75: dc.b "Always room for another hunter.",0
comm_text76: dc.b "Stay clear of the Vipers.",0
comm_text77: dc.b "See you on the trade lanes.",0
comm_text78: dc.b "Here's to a profitable raid.",0
comm_text79: dc.b "Good to see a fellow free spirit.",0
comm_text80: dc.b "X7!% KQ//9Z #R",0
comm_text81: dc.b "##V2 /XZ! 8%Q",0
comm_text82: dc.b "Q!9// R%X-7 KK",0
comm_text83: dc.b "7Z# X//%4 !RQ",0
comm_text84: dc.b "%K8! QQ/3Z ##X",0
comm_text85: dc.b "RX//9 !%K-2 V",0
comm_text86: dc.b "!!Z4 %QX// 7R",0
comm_text87: dc.b "K#7/ VV!% 0XZ",0
comm_text88: dc.b "9Q% !RX-4 //K",0
comm_text89: dc.b "ZZ/8# K!2% XR",0
comm_text90: dc.b "Justice has caught up with you.",0
comm_text91: dc.b "Your crime spree ends here.",0
comm_text92: dc.b "You won't escape this time.",0
comm_text93: dc.b "The chase is over.",0
comm_text94: dc.b "You've run out of chances.",0
comm_text95: dc.b "Your luck ends here.",0
comm_text96: dc.b "We have you in our sights.",0
comm_text97: dc.b "You should have stayed away.",0
comm_text98: dc.b "This is the end of the line.",0
comm_text99: dc.b "We're bringing you down.",0
comm_text100: dc.b "Hold your fire!",0
comm_text101: dc.b "Stop shooting at us!",0
comm_text102: dc.b "We're traders, not target practice!",0
comm_text103: dc.b "Watch your fire!",0
comm_text104: dc.b "Break off your attack!",0
comm_text105: dc.b "Leave our ship alone!",0
comm_text106: dc.b "Cease fire! This is a civilian ship.",0
comm_text107: dc.b "Back off and let us pass!",0
comm_text108: dc.b "Our cargo isn't worth this!",0
comm_text109: dc.b "Stop firing before someone dies!",0
comm_text110: dc.b 'Have a good flight. Do not cause trouble out there.',0
comm_text111: dc.b 'Departure cleared. Stay on the right side of the law.',0
comm_text112: dc.b 'Fly safe, and keep your weapons to yourself.',0
comm_text113: dc.b 'You may leave. Keep out of trouble.',0
comm_text114: dc.b 'Safe travels. We expect better behaviour out there.',0
comm_text115: dc.b 'Departure confirmed. Do not add to your record.',0
comm_text116: dc.b 'Good flight. Leave the other traders in peace.',0
comm_text117: dc.b 'You are clear to depart. Make this a lawful trip.',0
comm_text118: dc.b 'On your way. We will be watching your record.',0
comm_text119: dc.b 'Have a safe journey. Give our patrols no reason to stop you.',0
comm_text120: dc.b 'Illegal cargo detected. Your offence has been recorded.',0
comm_text121: dc.b 'Contraband found in your hold. Your record has been updated.',0
comm_text122: dc.b 'Cargo scan complete. Illegal goods detected.',0
comm_text123: dc.b 'You are carrying prohibited goods. This has been recorded.',0
comm_text124: dc.b 'Contraband detected. Your legal record has been updated.',0
comm_text125: dc.b 'Our scanners have detected illegal cargo aboard your ship.',0
comm_text126: dc.b 'Prohibited cargo found. This offence is on your record.',0
comm_text127: dc.b 'Illegal goods detected in your hold. Authorities notified.',0
comm_text128: dc.b 'Cargo inspection failed. Contraband has been recorded.',0
comm_text129: dc.b 'Your cargo violates the law. This offence has been logged.',0
    even
